#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
".\n"
"                            La purge supprime chaque nuit les résidents partis, les droits retirés et les ordres clos plus\n"
"                            vieux que ce délai, ainsi que les accès temporaires terminés ou annulés et, s'il y a une\n"
"                            tablette à l'entrée, son journal d'appels ; elle ne supprime jamais un retrait encore à faire."
msgstr ""
". Every night the purge deletes residents who have moved out, removed access"
" rights and closed orders older than this period, as well as ended or "
"cancelled temporary access and, if there is a tablet at the entrance, its "
"call log; it never deletes a removal still to be done."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
".\n"
"                            Résidents présents ou à venir :"
msgstr ""
".\n"
"                            Current or upcoming residents:"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
