msgstr "9. Risks and measures"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"<b>Biométrie</b> : exclue. Loi concernant le cadre juridique des "
"technologies de l'information, art. 44 et 45 (consentement exprès, "
"déclaration préalable à la Commission d'accès à l'information) ; le guide de"
" la Commission sur la biométrie (2022) demande en outre de démontrer "
"qu'aucun moyen moins intrusif ne suffit et d'offrir une solution de "
"rechange, le consentement devant rester libre (LPRPSP, art. 14)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Biometrics</b>: ruled out. Act to establish a legal framework for "
"information technology, ss. 44 and 45 (express consent, prior disclosure to "
"the Commission d'accès à l'information); the Commission's guide on "
"biometrics (2022) also asks to show that no less intrusive means will do and"
" to offer an alternative, since consent must remain free (private-sector "
"Act, s. 14)."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "<b>Codes</b> : jamais conservés ; ils vivent dans l'appareil."
msgstr "<b>Codes</b>: never kept; they live in the device."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"<b>Non recueillis par le logiciel</b> : codes (NIP), données biométriques, "
"journal des passages aux portes."
msgstr ""
"<b>Not collected by the software</b>: codes (PINs), biometric data, log of "
"door entries."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"<b>Retrait sur une date</b> : exclu pour un résident. Le bail se reconduit "
"de plein droit (art. 1941 C.c.Q.) ; un retrait suit un départ confirmé par "
"une personne. Un accès temporaire (visiteur, entrepreneur), lui, est retiré "
"à la fin de sa plage."
msgstr ""
"<b>Removal on a date</b>: excluded for a resident. The lease is renewed by "
"operation of law (art. 1941 CCQ); a removal follows a departure confirmed by"
" a person. A temporary access (visitor, contractor), on the other hand, is "
"removed at the end of its time window."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Accès par rôles : gestionnaire, consultation ; le responsable d'un point ne "
"fait que les ordres de ses points."
msgstr ""
"Role-based access: manager, consultation; the person responsible for an "
"access point carries out only the orders for their own points."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Accès temporaires : nom du visiteur, de l'entrepreneur ou du personnel (des "
"tiers qui n'ont rien consenti), entreprise, plage ; pour une entrée au "
"logement, motif, préavis, accord du locataire et motif d'urgence en texte "
"libre (à rédiger sans renseignement de santé)."
msgstr ""
"Temporary access: name of the visitor, contractor or staff member (third "
"parties who have consented to nothing), company, time window; for an entry "
"into the dwelling, the reason, notice, the lessee's agreement and the reason"
" for the emergency as free text (to be written without any health "
"information)."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "Aucun (ordres au responsable)"
msgstr "None (orders to the person responsible)"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_access_privacy.purpose_property_access_control
msgid ""
"Aucun code ni aucune donnée biométrique n'est conservé par le\n"
"                logiciel. Vos accès sont retirés une fois votre départ confirmé, et\n"
"                la trace en est supprimée après la durée fixée par\n"
"                l'organisation."
msgstr ""
"The software keeps no code and no biometric\n"
"                data. Your access is removed once your move-out is confirmed, and\n"
"                the record of it is deleted after the period set by\n"
"                the organisation."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Aucun connecteur relié à un appareil : les ordres vont au\n"
"                        responsable de chaque point, à l'interne. Aucune communication à un fabricant par le logiciel."
msgstr ""
"No connector linked to a device: the orders go to the\n"
"                        person responsible for each point, internally. The software discloses nothing to any manufacturer."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Aucune politique de conservation n'est déclarée pour le contrôle d'accès."
msgstr "No retention policy is declared for access control."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:privacy.notice,name:bf_property_access_privacy.notice_property_access_control
msgid "Avis : contrôle d'accès à l'immeuble"
msgstr "Notice: access control for the immovable"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__access_retention_declared
msgid ""
"Ce que la politique de conservation du contrôle d'accès annonce au registre "
"des activités de traitement."
msgstr ""
"What the access control retention policy announces in the register of "
"processing activities."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Cloisonnement par société ; journal des ordres non modifiable une fois clos."
msgstr ""
"Records separated by company; the order log cannot be changed once closed."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Connecteur"
msgstr "Connector"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Connecteurs déclarés :"
msgstr "Declared connectors:"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Consentements consignés pour la porte du logement, avec la personne qui les "
"a consignés."
msgstr ""
"Consents recorded for the unit door, with the person who recorded them."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.view_property_organisation_form_access_privacy
msgid ""
"Conservation des accès aux portes : droits, ordres, accès temporaires (Loi "
"25)"
msgstr ""
"Door access retention: access rights, orders, temporary access (Québec Act "
"25)"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:privacy.purpose,name:bf_property_access_privacy.purpose_property_access_control
msgid "Contrôle d'accès à l'immeuble"
msgstr "Access control for the immovable"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Contrôle d'accès à l'immeuble :"
msgstr "Access control for the immovable:"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Donner accès à l'immeuble aux personnes qui y habitent et le retirer à leur départ\n"
"                        confirmé. Le contrôle d'accès sert le bail et la sécurité des occupants : il ne repose pas\n"
"                        sur un consentement, mais sur une information préalable (avis « Contrôle d'accès à\n"
"                        l'immeuble » au registre des traitements). Une personne qui refuse un identifiant mobile\n"
"                        reçoit une clé ou une carte."
msgstr ""
"Give access to the immovable to the people who live there, and remove it once their departure\n"
"                        is confirmed. Access control serves the lease and the safety of the occupants: it does not rest\n"
"                        on consent, but on prior information (the \"Access control for the\n"
"                        immovable\" notice in the register of processing activities). A person who refuses a mobile credential\n"
"                        receives a key or a card."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Durée appliquée par l'organisation :"
msgstr "Period applied by the organisation:"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__access_retention_declared
msgid "Durée déclarée au registre (accès)"
msgstr "Period declared in the register (access)"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.view_property_organisation_form_access_privacy
msgid "Gabarit d'EFVP (contrôle d'accès)"
msgstr "PIA template (access control)"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:ir.actions.report,name:bf_property_access_privacy.action_report_access_efvp
msgid "Gabarit d'EFVP : contrôle d'accès"
msgstr "PIA template: access control"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Gabarit prérempli le"
msgstr "Template prefilled on"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Immeuble"
msgstr "Immovable"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"La serrure ne dépend jamais du logiciel : l'appareil valide seul, une panne "
"retarde un ajout ou un retrait."
msgstr ""
"The lock never depends on the software: the device validates on its own, and"
" an outage only delays an addition or a removal."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "Le gabarit d'EFVP est réservé à l'équipe immobilière."
msgstr "The PIA template is reserved for the property team."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Le registre des traitements annonce %(declared)d jours, cette organisation "
"en applique %(applied)d."
msgstr ""
"The register of processing activities announces %(declared)d days; this "
"organisation applies %(applied)d."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Le registre des traitements annonce %(declared)d jours, et cette "
"organisation ne purge pas le journal des accès. Ce qui est déclaré n'est pas"
" ce qui est fait."
msgstr ""
"The register of processing activities announces %(declared)d days, and this "
"organisation does not purge the access log. What is declared is not what is "
"done."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Le résident voit ses accès au portail et peut en demander la rectification (art. 28). Sur\n"
"                        demande, les renseignements informatisés recueillis auprès de lui, lui sont communiqués dans un format technologique\n"
"                        structuré et couramment utilisé (art. 27, al. 3), ce que l'évaluation doit vérifier (art. 3.3) :\n"
"                        l'export des listes du logiciel le permet."
msgstr ""
"Residents see their access on the portal and can ask for it to be corrected "
"(s. 28). On request, the computerized information collected from them is "
"released to them in a structured, commonly used technological format (s. 27,"
" para. 3), which the assessment must check (s. 3.3): the software's list "
"exports allow it."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Les deux durées diffèrent : ce qui est déclaré doit être ce qui est fait."
msgstr "The two periods differ: what is declared must be what is done."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Motif de fin d'un droit (départ, perte ou vol) et notes libres sur le "
"résident et le point d'accès."
msgstr ""
"Reason an access right ended (move-out, loss or theft) and free notes on the"
" resident and the access point."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Nom de la personne, immeuble et fraction, dates d'arrivée et de départ."
msgstr ""
"Name of the person, immovable and fraction, arrival and departure dates."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Ordres d'ajout et de retrait : qui les a faits, quand."
msgstr "Addition and removal orders: who carried them out, and when."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_access_privacy.model_bf_property_organisation
msgid "Organisation responsable d'un immeuble"
msgstr "Organisation answering for an immovable"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Origine du droit (propriété, bail, occupant déclaré) et signal de départ "
"tiré du dossier (fin du loyer, résiliation, déguerpissement…)."
msgstr ""
"Origin of the right (ownership, lease, declared occupant) and the move-out "
"signal read from the file (rent end, resiliation, abandonment…)."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Point d'accès"
msgstr "Access point"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Points d'accès autorisés, type de support et sa référence (numéro de carte, "
"identifiant d'annuaire)."
msgstr ""
"Authorized access points, credential type and its reference (card number, "
"directory ID)."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_access_privacy.purpose_property_access_control
msgid ""
"Pour que vous puissiez entrer chez vous, l'organisation tient la\n"
"                liste des personnes qui ont droit à chaque porte de l'immeuble\n"
"                (portier, garage, boîte à colis, porte du logement), le support\n"
"                remis (entrée d'annuaire, carte, code, clé) et sa référence, comme\n"
"                un numéro de carte."
msgstr ""
"So that you can get into your home, the organisation keeps the\n"
"                list of people entitled to each door of the immovable\n"
"                (intercom, garage, parcel locker, unit door), the credential\n"
"                issued (directory entry, card, code, key) and its reference, such as\n"
"                a card number."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_access_privacy.purpose_property_access_control
msgid ""
"Pour un visiteur, un entrepreneur ou une entrée dans un logement,\n"
"                l'organisation consigne aussi un accès temporaire : le nom du titulaire,\n"
"                son entreprise, la plage, et pour une entrée au logement son motif, le\n"
"                préavis et l'accord du locataire. Cet accès est retiré à la fin de sa\n"
"                plage."
msgstr ""
"For a visitor, a contractor or an entry into a dwelling,\n"
"                the organisation also records a temporary access: the holder's name,\n"
"                their company, the time window, and for an entry into the dwelling its reason, the\n"
"                notice and the lessee's agreement. This access is removed at the end of its\n"
"                time window."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_access_privacy.purpose_property_access_control
msgid ""
"Si l'immeuble a une tablette à l'entrée, vous n'y paraissez que si vous\n"
"                l'acceptez au portail, sous le libellé que vous choisissez ; chaque appel ou\n"
"                livraison est consigné (date, logement) et supprimé au délai fixé."
msgstr ""
"If the building has a tablet at the entrance, you appear on it only if you "
"agree on the portal, under the label you choose; each call or delivery is "
"recorded (date, unit) and deleted after the set period."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Credential"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"Tenir, pour chaque immeuble, la liste des personnes qui ont droit à chaque point\n"
"                            d'accès, et transmettre les ajouts et retraits aux appareils ou au responsable de\n"
"                            chaque point. Immeubles visés :"
msgstr ""
"Keep, for each immovable, the list of people entitled to each access\n"
"                            point, and pass the additions and removals on to the devices or to the person responsible for\n"
"                            each point. Immovables concerned:"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "aucune purge (0)"
msgstr "no purge (0)"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"ce que les appareils eux-mêmes enregistrent (journal des passages, images de"
" la caméra du portier) et où."
msgstr ""
"what the devices themselves record (log of door entries, intercom camera "
"images) and where."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"fournisseurs (logiciel, appareils, nuage), lieu d'hébergement, ententes "
"signées."
msgstr ""
"suppliers (software, devices, cloud), hosting location, signed agreements."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "jours"
msgstr "days"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "justification de la durée retenue ; conservation par les appareils."
msgstr "justification for the period chosen; retention by the devices."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"matériel en place (marque, modèle), qui l'exploite, date de mise en service."
msgstr ""
"equipment in place (make, model), who operates it, date put into service."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"mesures propres à l'organisation (comptes, sauvegardes, accès physique aux "
"appareils) ; à vérifier hors du logiciel : les serrures électromagnétiques "
"des issues se déverrouillent sur alarme incendie et panne de courant (CNB-Q "
"3.4.6.16)."
msgstr ""
"the organisation's own measures (accounts, backups, physical access to the "
"devices); to check outside the software: magnetic locks on exits release on "
"fire alarm and power failure (NBC-Québec 3.4.6.16)."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"pourquoi chaque point d'accès est nécessaire ; moyen moins intrusif envisagé"
" ; comment l'avis est remis à la personne lors de la collecte (bail, "
"affichage, page « Mes accès » du portail)."
msgstr ""
"why each access point is needed; less intrusive means considered; how the "
"notice reaches the person at collection (lease, posting, the portal's \"My "
"access\" page)."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"responsable de la protection des renseignements personnels consulté (nom, "
"date) ; décision ; date de révision."
msgstr ""
"person in charge of the protection of personal information consulted (name, "
"date); decision; review date."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"risques relevés (accès conservé après un départ, carte perdue, fuite de la "
"liste), probabilité, gravité, mesure."
msgstr ""
"risks identified (access kept after a departure, lost card, leak of the "
"list), likelihood, severity, measure."

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp_case
msgid "À compléter :"
msgstr "To be completed:"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__access_retention_warning
msgid "Écart de conservation (accès)"
msgstr "Retention gap (access)"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid "Évaluation des facteurs relatifs à la vie privée"
msgstr "Privacy impact assessment"

#. module: bf_property_access_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_privacy.report_access_efvp
msgid ""
"à partir\n"
"                            des données de Symbifox. Loi sur la protection des renseignements personnels dans le\n"
"                            secteur privé, art. 3.3 : une évaluation est obligatoire pour tout projet\n"
"                            d'acquisition, de développement ou de refonte d'un système d'information qui\n"
"                            touche des renseignements personnels, et le responsable de la protection des\n"
"                            renseignements personnels doit être consulté dès le début. Les faits ci-dessous\n"
"                            viennent du logiciel ; les cases sont à remplir par l'organisation."
msgstr ""
"from\n"
"                            Symbifox data. Act respecting the protection of personal information in the\n"
"                            private sector, art. 3.3: an assessment is required for any project\n"
"                            to acquire, develop or overhaul an information system that\n"
"                            involves personal information, and the person in charge of the protection of\n"
"                            personal information must be consulted from the outset. The facts below\n"
"                            come from the software; the boxes are to be filled in by the organisation."
